    "1/8 teaspoon crushed red pepper flakes"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to a toasty 450F. Either brush the pieces of bread lightly with oil or spray both sides with cooking spray. Place in oven for 1 to 2 minutes to harden and toast the crust.",
